  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9d952563-dbd1-57e3-b0f1-276fd696df58" activityNameId="082444f8-e0c2-512d-8572-b36bf547645a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Label housing system, pig, operation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Label housing system, pig, operation
The module includes the use of energy and auxiliary materials for the operation of lighting, feeding system, slurry agitator and pump, cleaning, drinking water. The functional unit is 1 fattening pig place during 1 year.;
UUID: 97d0eb6b-237e-3968-8d17-123eda39e9da
The inventory takes into account the energy and auxiliary materials like water, lubricating oil and cleaning agents for the use of the described module for one year. Also included is the use of the infrastructure with the binding of a certain part of the appropriate infrastructure module. Not taken into account were the direct emission of the animal husbandry, fodder production and produced waste water.
Location: The inventory applies for Swiss agricultural buildings only, because of the solid method of construction.
Technology: The use of energy and auxiliary materials are calculated for the conditions defined in the infrastructure-module with literature data and experts knowledge.
Time period: Period indicated in the reference. 
Production volume: na
Sampling: In the use of energy and auxiliary materials are big differences between the farms. The inventory is based on mean values from CH and WEU. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_97d0eb6b-237e-3968-8d17-123eda39e9da.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
